Danny: I think that’s a safe rule to follow.

4
00:00:10.056 --> 00:00:13.769
Tina: Follow me, boys!

5
00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:16.595
Tina: Look at this beautiful garden!

6
00:00:16.596 --> 00:00:19.119
Have you ever seen anything like it? Danny:

7
00:00:19.121 --> 00:00:23.676
Never. There are more flowers than I’ve ever seen! Brad:

8
