20
00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:12.093
Here, Brad, try an apple. Brad:

21
00:01:12.094 --> 00:01:14.312
I prefer oranges. Danny:

22
00:01:14.313 --> 00:01:16.619
Where did you find that? Tina:

23
00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:19.103
Over here, Danny! Brad:

24
00:01:19.104 --> 00:01:23.595
Follow me. Tina:

25
00:01:23.596 --> 00:01:26.996
Look! There’s a whole bunch of orange trees too! Brad:

26
00:01:26.997 --> 00:01:30.430
And over here, there are lemon trees! Danny:

27
00:01:30.431 --> 00:01:33.026
What’s that over there? Tina

28
00:01:33.027 --> 00:01:35.469
& Brad: Bananas! Brad:

