36
00:01:59.282 --> 00:02:03.166
Danny: The blue key got us to a world full of water.

37
00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:07.338
Brad: The red key brought us to a world full of snow.

38
00:02:07.339 --> 00:02:12.665
Tina: But really it is a world of flowers and fruit!

39
00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:17.903
Brad: Right. Danny, what other colors do you have?

40
00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:21.620
Danny: Yellow.

41
00:02:21.621 --> 00:02:23.447
Tina: Yellow.

42
00:02:23.448 --> 00:02:25.004
Brad: Yellow.

43
00:02:25.005 --> 00:02:28.072
Danny: What does it mean?

44
00:02:28.073 --> 00:02:32.301
Brad: Do you think the yellow clay is the key to the giants’ world?

45
00:02:32.302 --> 00:02:33.769
Danny: I don’t

46
00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:36.352
know. What else could yellow be

47
00:02:36.353 --> 00:02:38.037
for? Tina:

48
00:02:38.038 --> 00:02:42.076
Bananas? Brad: The point is we just don’t

49
00:02:42.077 --> 00:02:45.005
know. Do we want to take the chance again?

50
00:02:45.006 --> 00:02:47.931
Danny: What other choice do we have?

51
00:02:47.932 --> 00:02:51.420
Tina: Danny’s right. We don’t even know how to get home.

52
00:02:51.421 --> 00:02:55.773
Brad: So we need to try the yellow clay? Agreed?

53
00:02:55.774 --> 00:03:01.106
Danny & Tina: Agreed!

